WEBVTT

1
00:00:49.096 --> 00:00:50.848
<i>In days of legend,</i>

2
00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:54.184
<i>gods walked the Earth...</i>

3
00:00:55.727 --> 00:00:57.938
<i>and tormented mortals.</i>

4
00:01:00.899 --> 00:01:04.235
<i>Athena, goddess of warfare and wisdom,</i>

5
00:01:04.318 --> 00:01:07.155
<i>had the power to destroy humanity,</i>

6
00:01:07.239 --> 00:01:09.199
<i>but chose to protect us.</i>

7
00:01:10.242 --> 00:01:13.203
<i>Brave young knights from across the globe</i>

8
00:01:13.287 --> 00:01:15.873
<i>swore their allegiance to her.</i>

9
00:01:15.956 --> 00:01:17.541
<i>They learned to harness Cosmo...</i>

10
00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:20.961
<i>the power of the stars.</i>

11
00:01:22.421 --> 00:01:24.798
<i>Their fists cracked to the heavens</i>

12
00:01:24.882 --> 00:01:27.968
<i>in battles against those
who wished Athena dead.</i>

13
00:01:32.139 --> 00:01:33.348
<i>Over time...</i>

14
00:01:34.183 --> 00:01:37.311
<i>the gods retreated and became myths.</i>

15
00:01:38.353 --> 00:01:40.772
<i>But then, 18 years ago,</i>

16
00:01:40.856 --> 00:01:44.860
<i>Athena was reborn as a helpless child.</i>

17
00:01:46.028 --> 00:01:49.531
<i>A knight clad in gold armor</i>

18
00:01:49.615 --> 00:01:53.368
<i>gave his life to protect her
as they crashed to Earth.</i>

19
00:01:55.412 --> 00:01:59.166
<i>And that's how I found her,
lying in his arms.</i>

20
00:01:59.249 --> 00:02:01.919
<i>A mortal girl with the power of a god.</i>

21
00:02:02.836 --> 00:02:04.129
<i>Since then,</i>

22
00:02:04.213 --> 00:02:07.841
<i>I've been searching
for a new generation of knights</i>

23
00:02:07.925 --> 00:02:10.511
<i>to protect Athena and the Earth.</i>

24
00:02:20.729 --> 00:02:24.733
<i>We fight to protect ourselves.</i>

25
00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:32.741
<i>But we also fight to protect each other.</i>

26
00:02:37.496 --> 00:02:40.290
<i>There's always something bigger
than you, Seiya.</i>

27
00:02:41.041 --> 00:02:43.669
<i>You'll have to fight
to protect that as well.</i>

28
00:02:50.843 --> 00:02:52.302
You give up?

29
00:02:52.386 --> 00:02:53.387
<i>Never!</i>

30
00:02:56.014 --> 00:02:58.100
Nice try. But not tonight.

31
00:02:58.183 --> 00:02:59.810
-Tap out.
-No!

32
00:02:59.893 --> 00:03:01.562
You must learn when to quit!

33
00:03:01.645 --> 00:03:03.188
Never!

34
00:03:07.734 --> 00:03:09.611
No, Seiya! Don't!

35
00:03:11.655 --> 00:03:12.990
Promise you won't come out.

36
00:03:13.073 --> 00:03:13.991
I promise.

37
00:03:25.752 --> 00:03:26.837
Hey, kid!

38
00:03:28.547 --> 00:03:30.090
Come on, you're up next.

39
00:04:05.042 --> 00:04:07.753
You win this fight,
maybe you get a shot at me someday.

40
00:04:09.046 --> 00:04:10.756
Hey! Listen to me.

41
00:04:10.839 --> 00:04:13.175
No more of that dancing around,
you understand?

42
00:04:13.258 --> 00:04:15.010
You make it a good show this time.

43
00:04:17.387 --> 00:04:19.056
Fight this time, asshole.

44
00:04:19.139 --> 00:04:21.683
It's time for the main event!

45
00:04:21.767 --> 00:04:26.021
Introducing first,
the undisputed champion of the Octagon.

46
00:04:26.104 --> 00:04:29.483
Give it up for Jaki the Beast!

47
00:04:29.566 --> 00:04:35.864
<i>Jaki! Jaki! Jaki!</i>

48
00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:43.539
And the contender,
who literally danced his way

49
00:04:43.622 --> 00:04:45.332
through his first two fights,

50
00:04:46.083 --> 00:04:50.087
let's hear it for Street Kid Seiya!

51
00:04:55.509 --> 00:04:57.010
You both know how this works.

52
00:04:59.596 --> 00:05:02.099
You know the rules. There are none.

53
00:05:02.182 --> 00:05:04.852
Anything goes until one of you
gives up or blacks out.

54
00:05:06.812 --> 00:05:09.898
If you give up,
you're banished from the Octagon.

55
00:05:09.982 --> 00:05:11.400
Understood?

56
00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:33.005
Damn it, fight!

57
00:05:36.592 --> 00:05:38.677
Hey! I said, no dancing!

58
00:06:03.911 --> 00:06:06.663
<i>Cassios! Cassios! Cassios!</i>

59
00:06:06.747 --> 00:06:08.790
What, you think you can just ignore me?

60
00:06:09.625 --> 00:06:11.001
Okay, calm down, big guy.

61
00:06:25.974 --> 00:06:27.392
Ballet's over, kid.

62
00:06:58.298 --> 00:07:00.259
Cassios wins.

63
00:07:00.342 --> 00:07:01.426
Every...

64
00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:02.678
single...

65
00:07:02.761 --> 00:07:03.762
time.

66
00:07:09.852 --> 00:07:15.858
<i>Cassios! Cassios! Cassios!</i>

67
00:07:38.297 --> 00:07:39.506
You give up?

68
00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:17.711
Yeah!

69
00:08:35.187 --> 00:08:36.688
You don't know when to quit, huh?

70
00:08:38.148 --> 00:08:39.149
Yeah.

71
00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:40.859
I've heard that before.

72
00:08:57.543 --> 00:08:59.169
We're not done here!

73
00:09:03.882 --> 00:09:05.217
This ain't over!

74
00:09:16.937 --> 00:09:18.063
Come outside.

75
00:09:19.314 --> 00:09:21.942
You're cute, but you're not my type, man.

76
00:09:26.071 --> 00:09:30.242
There's someone outside
that wants to speak with you.

77
00:09:30.325 --> 00:09:31.952
He knows about your search.

78
00:09:33.871 --> 00:09:35.581
He knows what you're looking for.

79
00:09:51.471 --> 00:09:52.472
Give me that.

80
00:09:59.938 --> 00:10:01.148
Yeah, it's me.

81
00:10:04.067 --> 00:10:06.445
Think I found one of your Cosmo guys.

82
00:10:19.458 --> 00:10:20.459
I'm out of here.

83
00:10:22.211 --> 00:10:25.547
Your little show in there made
some people upset.

84
00:10:25.631 --> 00:10:27.257
Look, I'm not looking for trouble.

85
00:10:27.341 --> 00:10:29.468
You may not be looking,
but you've found it.

86
00:10:30.552 --> 00:10:34.014
In a few moments,
Vander Guraad will be here with her boys.

87
00:10:35.265 --> 00:10:36.266
Who?

88
00:10:37.059 --> 00:10:38.268
My ex-wife.

89
00:10:38.352 --> 00:10:39.978
She controls this fighting ring.

90
00:10:40.062 --> 00:10:42.064
It's her recruitment operation.

91
00:10:43.023 --> 00:10:44.566
What does she recruit?

92
00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:47.361
Warriors with special skills.

93
00:10:47.444 --> 00:10:48.654
For her private army.

94
00:10:49.988 --> 00:10:50.989
Okay.

95
00:10:51.073 --> 00:10:52.741
I saw what you did in the ring.

96
00:10:53.492 --> 00:10:55.702
I knew it had to be you, Seiya.

97
00:10:59.248 --> 00:11:00.249
Who are you?

98
00:11:01.083 --> 00:11:03.001
I'm the only friend you have.

99
00:11:04.753 --> 00:11:06.463
You need to make a choice, Seiya.

100
00:11:06.547 --> 00:11:10.008
Come with me or try your luck
against Guraad's warriors.

101
00:11:16.098 --> 00:11:17.432
Lead the way.

102
00:11:24.648 --> 00:11:25.732
Come on!

103
00:11:36.159 --> 00:11:37.578
Look what we've found.

104
00:11:47.212 --> 00:11:48.547
What are those guys made of?

105
00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:50.340
You don't want to know. Keep moving!

106
00:12:04.229 --> 00:12:05.689
Our ride's just around the corner!

107
00:12:11.612 --> 00:12:12.738
Get down!

108
00:12:29.796 --> 00:12:30.964
Go!

109
00:12:32.925 --> 00:12:35.052
Meet Mylock, my assistant.

110
00:12:39.973 --> 00:12:42.100
Those guys work for your ex-wife?

111
00:12:42.684 --> 00:12:44.269
Surrender the boy!

112
00:12:49.942 --> 00:12:51.777
Dude, you gotta make better life choices.

113
00:13:00.994 --> 00:13:02.454
What the hell is that thing?

114
00:13:07.251 --> 00:13:08.752
Hope you had a light dinner.

115
00:13:35.445 --> 00:13:36.446
Why are they after me?

116
00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:38.448
They're after warriors
with a strong Cosmo.

117
00:13:43.662 --> 00:13:45.706
Cosmo? Is that a new martial arts
or something?

118
00:13:46.415 --> 00:13:48.625
You should know.
You tapped into it in the Octagon.

119
00:13:48.709 --> 00:13:51.128
I didn't tap into anything.
They got the wrong guy!

120
00:13:51.211 --> 00:13:53.338
Oh, would you like us to stop
and let them know?

121
00:14:05.767 --> 00:14:06.768
God!

122
00:14:26.163 --> 00:14:27.539
Hold on tight!

123
00:14:46.308 --> 00:14:49.019
I am not going another step
until you tell me what's going on.

124
00:14:49.102 --> 00:14:50.812
There'll be time for that later.

125
00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:53.023
We're still in danger.

126
00:14:53.106 --> 00:14:54.483
You're really--

127
00:14:59.947 --> 00:15:02.533
<i>Okay, okay, okay. Go to sleep.</i>

128
00:15:19.216 --> 00:15:21.134
Hey. Hey. Wake up. Wake up.

129
00:15:22.719 --> 00:15:23.971
Wake up. Come on.

130
00:15:26.849 --> 00:15:29.810
You need to hide. No matter what happens,
you stay out of sight.

131
00:15:29.893 --> 00:15:32.312
I have to make sure
these people don't find you.

132
00:15:32.396 --> 00:15:33.856
Promise you won't come out.

133
00:15:34.648 --> 00:15:36.817
Okay. I promise.

134
00:16:05.012 --> 00:16:05.846
Thank you.

135
00:16:06.388 --> 00:16:07.389
For what?

136
00:16:09.683 --> 00:16:11.185
You tapped into your Cosmo.

137
00:16:12.477 --> 00:16:14.813
<i>No, Seiya. Don't!</i>

138
00:16:17.524 --> 00:16:19.484
<i>Led me right to your doorstep.</i>

139
00:16:24.239 --> 00:16:26.366
Saved me so much trouble.

140
00:16:30.204 --> 00:16:31.038
Let's go!

141
00:16:31.747 --> 00:16:32.581
Let's go!

142
00:16:32.664 --> 00:16:35.167
You can't use it. Only the Pegasus can!

143
00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:36.877
That's why you're coming with us.

144
00:17:02.361 --> 00:17:03.403
Relax.

145
00:17:04.947 --> 00:17:06.364
Relax, we're safe now.

146
00:17:07.324 --> 00:17:08.158
Safe?

147
00:17:08.242 --> 00:17:10.244
First I get attacked by ninja cyborgs,

148
00:17:10.326 --> 00:17:11.995
then I got a spaceship shooting at me.

149
00:17:12.079 --> 00:17:14.247
And then that freak in a suit drugs me!

150
00:17:14.331 --> 00:17:16.874
Allow me to rephrase it.

151
00:17:16.959 --> 00:17:19.002
You're safer here than with Guraad.

152
00:17:19.085 --> 00:17:21.630
She has already captured
many kids like you,

153
00:17:21.713 --> 00:17:22.922
drained them of their Cosmo.

154
00:17:23.006 --> 00:17:25.132
Stop talking nonsense
and tell me what's going on!

155
00:17:25.968 --> 00:17:27.553
-Prepare for landing.
-What?

156
00:17:27.636 --> 00:17:29.930
You might want to buckle up.

157
00:17:30.013 --> 00:17:31.181
No, I want answers now!

158
00:17:31.974 --> 00:17:33.058
Oh, shit.

159
00:17:40.023 --> 00:17:41.275
There's no runway!

160
00:17:44.528 --> 00:17:46.113
I said, you might want to buckle up.

161
00:17:56.623 --> 00:17:59.126
You couldn't just tell me
this thing lands vertically?

162
00:18:06.049 --> 00:18:07.885
Let's start afresh, shall we?

163
00:18:08.510 --> 00:18:10.429
My name is Alman Kido.

164
00:18:10.512 --> 00:18:13.223
Once upon a time, I was a businessman.

165
00:18:13.307 --> 00:18:15.767
Mylock, let her know our guest
has arrived, please.

166
00:18:15.851 --> 00:18:17.019
Yes, sir.

167
00:18:17.102 --> 00:18:19.104
Should I believe you went bust?

168
00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:24.067
I won't hide the fact
I've been quite successful in my trade.

169
00:18:24.151 --> 00:18:26.945
But the one thing
money can't buy is purpose.

170
00:18:27.029 --> 00:18:29.531
So this is where you store your "purpose"?

171
00:18:30.490 --> 00:18:31.491
Yes.

172
00:18:34.786 --> 00:18:36.580
Tell me, Seiya, what do you see?

173
00:18:40.042 --> 00:18:41.210
I'm not sure.

174
00:18:41.793 --> 00:18:44.296
A whole bunch of real old stuff, I guess.

175
00:18:45.422 --> 00:18:47.049
I see stories.

176
00:18:47.132 --> 00:18:51.720
Ancient heroes were defined
by their monumental deeds

177
00:18:51.803 --> 00:18:53.847
as much as by their tragic ends.

178
00:18:54.681 --> 00:18:59.228
I always admired
the formidable magnitude of their fate.

179
00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:05.150
I envied it. I used to think
the ancient lore held no secret for me.

180
00:19:06.985 --> 00:19:08.487
I'm afraid that was my hubris.

181
00:19:10.447 --> 00:19:12.324
What do you know about Athena?

182
00:19:12.407 --> 00:19:15.452
-She was a god of war.
-And wisdom.

183
00:19:15.536 --> 00:19:18.622
What if I told you
Athena had returned in human form

184
00:19:18.705 --> 00:19:23.001
and you are destined
to become one of her guardian knights?

185
00:19:23.085 --> 00:19:25.462
I'd say your therapist isn't worth
his paycheck.

186
00:19:26.839 --> 00:19:29.258
Things happen for a reason, Seiya.

187
00:19:29.341 --> 00:19:31.051
Your Cosmo brought you here.

188
00:19:31.134 --> 00:19:33.595
Actually, I was brought here
on a very expensive aircraft.

189
00:19:34.346 --> 00:19:36.348
And now I'm leaving on my own two feet.

190
00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:40.561
You know the truth in your heart, Seiya.

191
00:19:40.644 --> 00:19:42.145
Your sister knew it too.

192
00:19:50.904 --> 00:19:52.656
What do you know about my sister?

193
00:19:52.739 --> 00:19:56.743
Ten years ago,
Guraad detected a strong Cosmo

194
00:19:56.827 --> 00:19:58.954
at your location.
She thought it was Patricia.

195
00:19:59.037 --> 00:20:00.372
What did she do to her?

196
00:20:00.455 --> 00:20:03.667
I don't know,
but your sister gave herself up

197
00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:06.044
so that Guraad wouldn't find you.

198
00:20:06.128 --> 00:20:08.714
She knew what you were to become.

199
00:20:08.797 --> 00:20:11.633
A warrior of Athena. The Pegasus Knight.

200
00:20:12.176 --> 00:20:13.427
The Pegasus Knight?

201
00:20:14.261 --> 00:20:15.846
You're really out of your mind.

202
00:20:17.097 --> 00:20:18.849
That doesn't bode well.

203
00:20:18.932 --> 00:20:20.184
This is Sienna.

204
00:20:21.643 --> 00:20:23.896
Guraad is after her too.

205
00:20:23.979 --> 00:20:25.397
Your mission is to protect her.

206
00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:27.274
I can take care of myself.

207
00:20:27.357 --> 00:20:30.027
Why would I ever want
to risk my neck to protect some rich girl?

208
00:20:31.111 --> 00:20:35.073
Because our little Sienna here is
the reincarnation of the goddess Athena.

209
00:20:35.157 --> 00:20:38.202
-Dad.
-Don't you have something for our guest?

210
00:20:38.285 --> 00:20:40.704
Sure, a toilet,
so he can flush himself out.

211
00:20:40.787 --> 00:20:43.081
Wow, spoken like a true goddess.

212
00:20:43.165 --> 00:20:47.127
Dad, come on. This moron can't
seriously be the Pegasus Knight.

213
00:20:48.837 --> 00:20:49.838
Go on.

214
00:20:53.509 --> 00:20:54.635
Fine.

215
00:20:54.718 --> 00:20:56.929
You might recognize this, Seiya.

216
00:21:11.318 --> 00:21:12.402
This is Patricia's.

217
00:21:13.320 --> 00:21:15.989
That is the key to the Pegasus armor.

218
00:21:16.073 --> 00:21:18.992
Without it, you don't stand a chance
against Guraad's army.

219
00:21:19.076 --> 00:21:20.369
I could've handled those guys.

220
00:21:20.452 --> 00:21:21.954
That's not what Mylock said.

221
00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:28.043
So how's this supposed
to help me find my sister?

222
00:21:28.126 --> 00:21:30.587
You give me a little present
and expect me to help you out?

223
00:21:30.671 --> 00:21:32.673
My plan is to trust you
to do what is right.

224
00:21:32.756 --> 00:21:33.966
And what would that be?

225
00:21:34.049 --> 00:21:37.344
I suppose you've never heard of Marin,
the Silver Knight.

226
00:21:37.427 --> 00:21:39.179
God, another one of your old legends?

227
00:21:39.263 --> 00:21:41.557
Marin can teach you how to reveal

228
00:21:41.640 --> 00:21:43.225
the hidden secret of the pendant.

229
00:21:43.308 --> 00:21:46.270
So you can protect Sienna,
and yourself, against your enemies.

230
00:21:46.353 --> 00:21:48.438
And maybe even help you find your sister.

231
00:21:48.522 --> 00:21:50.190
Ancient gods. Magic knights.

232
00:21:50.274 --> 00:21:52.776
Do you have any idea
how totally insane you sound?

233
00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:56.405
I know, it is a lot to take in, isn't it?

234
00:21:56.488 --> 00:22:00.325
So why don't we have breakfast,
take the day off and...

235
00:22:01.285 --> 00:22:03.453
revisit this tomorrow. Yeah.

236
00:22:06.957 --> 00:22:08.667
Well, I am hungry, but...

237
00:22:08.750 --> 00:22:10.711
A goddess's fate is on the line, but sure.

238
00:22:10.794 --> 00:22:12.796
Let's eat pancakes.

239
00:22:14.381 --> 00:22:15.215
Yeah.

240
00:22:25.893 --> 00:22:27.811
Get off my ring, you scum.

241
00:22:28.562 --> 00:22:29.771
Get out of my ring!

242
00:22:31.273 --> 00:22:32.858
You moron.

243
00:22:32.941 --> 00:22:34.902
You were supposed to keep a low profile.

244
00:22:35.611 --> 00:22:36.820
And I did.

245
00:22:36.904 --> 00:22:39.114
We need to shut this place down.

246
00:22:39.198 --> 00:22:42.618
-You don't get to decide that!
-That's right. I do.

247
00:22:42.701 --> 00:22:44.286
Guraad, come on.

248
00:22:45.037 --> 00:22:46.496
We have a great partnership.

249
00:22:46.580 --> 00:22:48.415
Yes. We did.

250
00:22:49.541 --> 00:22:51.460
How's the boy's Cosmo?

251
00:22:51.543 --> 00:22:52.878
It's legit.

252
00:22:52.961 --> 00:22:55.964
Good news. I've got a new deal for you.

253
00:22:56.548 --> 00:22:58.717
No ring, no deal.

254
00:22:58.800 --> 00:22:59.676
All the better.

255
00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:02.554
Nobody needs a loser who gets
his ass kicked by a scrawny kid.

256
00:23:02.638 --> 00:23:04.640
He got a lucky break.

257
00:23:04.723 --> 00:23:06.892
No man gets lucky twice with Cassios.

258
00:23:06.975 --> 00:23:09.478
I can beat anyone, anytime.

259
00:23:09.561 --> 00:23:10.938
Well, let's see if that's true.

260
00:23:29.081 --> 00:23:30.082
Something wrong?

261
00:23:33.752 --> 00:23:36.672
I just don't know how you can breathe
while you're eating like that.

262
00:23:40.801 --> 00:23:44.054
Where I come from, you eat
as much as you can, when you can.

263
00:23:45.848 --> 00:23:48.058
You never know
where your next meal's coming from.

264
00:23:52.020 --> 00:23:53.272
You wouldn't understand.

265
00:23:56.066 --> 00:23:57.067
Rich girl.

266
00:23:59.862 --> 00:24:01.238
No, I wouldn't.

267
00:24:02.489 --> 00:24:04.199
But I'm sorry you had to live like that.

268
00:24:09.496 --> 00:24:11.999
Sir. There's an urgent call.

269
00:24:13.625 --> 00:24:14.960
Please excuse me.

270
00:24:25.220 --> 00:24:26.221
So...

271
00:24:27.848 --> 00:24:29.683
How does it feel to be a goddess?

272
00:24:32.352 --> 00:24:35.522
Well, I'm not a goddess yet.

273
00:24:36.732 --> 00:24:37.900
Just Sienna.

274
00:24:37.983 --> 00:24:40.777
But her Cosmo is getting stronger
by the day,

275
00:24:40.861 --> 00:24:43.447
and someday soon I will become Athena.

276
00:24:48.410 --> 00:24:50.579
Most people would be excited

277
00:24:51.371 --> 00:24:53.290
to have breakfast with a future goddess.

278
00:24:56.251 --> 00:24:57.669
Guess I'm not most people, then.

279
00:24:59.379 --> 00:25:01.131
Well, then maybe you should--

280
00:25:04.801 --> 00:25:06.220
Maybe I should what?

281
00:25:13.685 --> 00:25:14.978
You should back off.

282
00:25:15.687 --> 00:25:16.980
Jeez, don't be so sensitive.

283
00:25:19.149 --> 00:25:20.442
Just get away from me, okay?

284
00:25:20.526 --> 00:25:22.069
-Okay, I'm sorry.
-Just get away--

285
00:25:30.786 --> 00:25:31.620
Hey!

286
00:25:33.664 --> 00:25:35.123
Dad!

287
00:25:35.666 --> 00:25:36.542
Hey!

288
00:25:37.167 --> 00:25:39.127
-Are you okay?
-Wait!

289
00:25:42.965 --> 00:25:44.341
What's going on?

290
00:25:45.008 --> 00:25:46.718
She could kill you right now.

291
00:25:47.219 --> 00:25:49.388
I'm here, sweetheart, just relax.

292
00:25:57.688 --> 00:25:58.814
What just happened?

293
00:26:03.443 --> 00:26:06.446
She bears a goddess's Cosmo
in the body of a mortal.

294
00:26:13.328 --> 00:26:17.124
When our sensors detect
a potential Cosmo burst,

295
00:26:17.833 --> 00:26:20.502
the building automatically
blocks the signal.

296
00:26:21.587 --> 00:26:24.840
It's the only way we can keep
Sienna hidden from Guraad.

297
00:26:24.923 --> 00:26:27.759
Which is why I am stuck here
like a prisoner.

298
00:26:32.014 --> 00:26:33.015
Excuse me.

299
00:26:34.433 --> 00:26:37.227
Wait. Wait, so... So you really are...?

300
00:26:48.197 --> 00:26:50.741
You really think this guy could beat
the Pegasus Knight?

301
00:26:51.366 --> 00:26:53.994
Perhaps. If we give him the prototype.

302
00:27:07.549 --> 00:27:09.051
Next candidate?

303
00:27:13.555 --> 00:27:14.556
You giving up already?

304
00:27:25.484 --> 00:27:27.277
What the hell are you made of?

305
00:27:28.695 --> 00:27:29.655
Disengage.

306
00:27:34.368 --> 00:27:35.827
We ain't done yet.

307
00:27:41.375 --> 00:27:43.710
You made your point, Cassios.

308
00:27:43.794 --> 00:27:45.087
You're a strong man.

309
00:27:45.796 --> 00:27:48.131
But you're just a man.

310
00:27:53.303 --> 00:27:54.596
I have a problem.

311
00:27:54.680 --> 00:27:56.390
You met him in your ring.

312
00:27:57.224 --> 00:27:58.058
The kid.

313
00:27:58.141 --> 00:27:59.977
His power's a liability.

314
00:28:00.644 --> 00:28:04.439
Once he learns to control it,
no living man will be able to stop him.

315
00:28:05.524 --> 00:28:07.484
What, you think I could, though?

316
00:28:08.193 --> 00:28:10.529
You know, with your prototype thing?

317
00:28:11.530 --> 00:28:12.531
I have a good ear.

318
00:28:13.490 --> 00:28:14.825
So, what's your price?

319
00:28:17.202 --> 00:28:18.453
Well, that depends.

320
00:28:19.705 --> 00:28:20.873
Can I kill him?

321
00:28:20.956 --> 00:28:22.624
That's kind of the point.

322
00:28:23.625 --> 00:28:24.960
I'll do it for free.

323
00:28:50.944 --> 00:28:53.238
-You all right?
-I'm better.

324
00:28:54.406 --> 00:28:57.326
-You?
-I'm good. I guess.

325
00:28:59.203 --> 00:29:01.872
It's just that I can't believe
you really are a--

326
00:29:01.955 --> 00:29:02.956
A goddess?

327
00:29:05.083 --> 00:29:06.877
I'm never gonna call you that.

328
00:29:06.960 --> 00:29:08.670
That's fine with me.

329
00:29:10.130 --> 00:29:13.926
So how do people usually react
when they learn you're Athena?

330
00:29:14.718 --> 00:29:15.552
Varies.

331
00:29:16.512 --> 00:29:19.431
Like, the day after I was born,
someone tried to kill me.

332
00:29:19.515 --> 00:29:20.516
No.

333
00:29:22.392 --> 00:29:25.521
Not even you could annoy someone
that much in just one day.

334
00:29:26.438 --> 00:29:29.733
I was told a knight in gold armor
gave his life to save mine.

335
00:29:31.193 --> 00:29:33.612
When they found him,
he was still holding me in his arms.

336
00:29:33.695 --> 00:29:35.697
Who found you? Alman?

337
00:29:36.740 --> 00:29:37.741
And Guraad.

338
00:29:40.202 --> 00:29:42.704
Though she was a little more
into the gold armor.

339
00:29:43.830 --> 00:29:47.459
Used it to develop technology
far beyond anything you could imagine.

340
00:29:48.835 --> 00:29:49.878
Look at the bright side.

341
00:29:51.129 --> 00:29:52.965
Half your foster family is great.

342
00:29:54.258 --> 00:29:56.885
When Alman's around you,
he almost looks like a real dad.

343
00:29:58.345 --> 00:30:01.598
Alman is my dad, and I love him
more than anything in the world.

344
00:30:03.225 --> 00:30:07.104
Although that might be hard
for you to understand, street boy.

345
00:30:08.647 --> 00:30:09.648
I do.

346
00:30:12.693 --> 00:30:14.528
I had someone like that once.

347
00:30:16.238 --> 00:30:17.239
Your sister?

348
00:30:19.950 --> 00:30:21.201
What was she like?

349
00:30:23.161 --> 00:30:24.621
She was kind.

350
00:30:26.748 --> 00:30:27.958
<i>And strong.</i>

351
00:30:29.293 --> 00:30:31.837
And protected me
when I couldn't protect myself.

352
00:30:33.255 --> 00:30:35.215
And you won't stop until you find her.

353
00:30:35.299 --> 00:30:38.260
You really don't care that I've become
your bodyguard, do you?

354
00:30:39.011 --> 00:30:41.221
I will someday become Athena.

355
00:30:42.097 --> 00:30:43.515
I don't have a choice.

356
00:30:43.599 --> 00:30:46.268
But that doesn't mean you have
to become the Pegasus Knight.

357
00:30:46.351 --> 00:30:48.020
Alman said it's my destiny.

358
00:30:48.103 --> 00:30:50.105
Nobody's destiny is written in stone.

359
00:30:51.607 --> 00:30:52.691
Except yours.

360
00:30:54.234 --> 00:30:56.069
Your Cosmo bursts,

361
00:30:56.153 --> 00:30:57.905
do they come with visions?

362
00:30:58.614 --> 00:30:59.948
You have visions too?

363
00:31:00.032 --> 00:31:01.200
What does it matter?

364
00:31:01.283 --> 00:31:05.454
Cosmo visions are a window
into the universe.

365
00:31:06.830 --> 00:31:08.081
They can show us things.

366
00:31:11.418 --> 00:31:14.087
So that Silver Knight
your dad mentioned...?

367
00:31:14.171 --> 00:31:15.797
-Who, Marin?
-Marin.

368
00:31:15.881 --> 00:31:18.425
Do you think if he could teach me
to control my Cosmo,

369
00:31:18.509 --> 00:31:20.135
I could use it to find my sister?

370
00:31:21.136 --> 00:31:22.179
Maybe.

371
00:31:24.306 --> 00:31:25.516
If that's what you want.

372
00:32:00.551 --> 00:32:02.845
He's drained of Cosmo, Guraad.

373
00:32:06.139 --> 00:32:07.683
Won't get another dose.

374
00:32:09.852 --> 00:32:12.396
The prototype procedure has started.

375
00:32:12.980 --> 00:32:14.481
It'll be ready tomorrow.

376
00:32:15.190 --> 00:32:16.275
Any issues?

377
00:32:16.900 --> 00:32:17.901
Just one.

378
00:32:18.819 --> 00:32:20.153
Why Cassios?

379
00:32:20.946 --> 00:32:22.364
'Cause you failed.

380
00:32:24.533 --> 00:32:27.995
You know, the target was assisted
by Alman Kido.

381
00:32:28.078 --> 00:32:30.038
A personal bad penny.

382
00:32:31.790 --> 00:32:33.625
Athena's growing stronger by the day,

383
00:32:33.709 --> 00:32:36.545
and now she'll have
the Pegasus Knight by her side.

384
00:32:36.628 --> 00:32:40.632
I reckon the boy's got some Cosmo.
Doesn't mean he's a knight yet.

385
00:32:40.716 --> 00:32:42.634
I don't need cold comfort, Nero.

386
00:32:42.718 --> 00:32:45.387
I need to know where on Earth
Alman is hiding the girl.

387
00:32:45.470 --> 00:32:48.015
So we can neutralize her
before she becomes Athena

388
00:32:48.098 --> 00:32:49.474
and destroys the world.

389
00:32:51.059 --> 00:32:52.102
Beats me.

390
00:32:54.021 --> 00:32:55.981
But you could always ask our prisoner.

391
00:32:59.026 --> 00:33:00.194
We have a prisoner?

392
00:33:36.730 --> 00:33:37.564
Hey!

393
00:33:38.440 --> 00:33:39.566
Hey, wait up.

394
00:33:40.317 --> 00:33:41.360
Yeah?

395
00:33:42.611 --> 00:33:46.406
I... I just figured you could focus more
on your training if you weren't

396
00:33:46.490 --> 00:33:48.992
worried about where your next meal
was coming from.

397
00:33:50.661 --> 00:33:51.495
Thanks.

398
00:33:59.169 --> 00:34:00.295
Thank you.

399
00:34:01.797 --> 00:34:02.798
I guess.

400
00:34:05.676 --> 00:34:06.677
Seiya!

401
00:34:07.594 --> 00:34:08.720
Time to go.

402
00:34:11.557 --> 00:34:12.558
See you.

403
00:34:15.769 --> 00:34:16.769
Take a seat.

404
00:34:21.567 --> 00:34:23.318
Don't get any big ideas.

405
00:34:24.236 --> 00:34:27.614
Goddesses don't have boyfriends.

406
00:34:27.698 --> 00:34:29.575
-How many dads does Sienna have?
-Buckle up.

407
00:34:39.918 --> 00:34:40.919
Lunchbox?

408
00:34:42.796 --> 00:34:44.506
That's unusually kind of you.

409
00:34:46.800 --> 00:34:48.969
I just thought
he might as well enjoy his last meal,

410
00:34:49.052 --> 00:34:51.262
since Marin's probably
gonna kill him anyway.

411
00:34:52.764 --> 00:34:53.765
Right.

412
00:35:16.538 --> 00:35:18.457
So where am I supposed to go?

413
00:35:25.297 --> 00:35:27.132
Okay. Just drop me off up there.

414
00:35:27.216 --> 00:35:28.717
Not how it works.

415
00:35:47.778 --> 00:35:51.532
"Those who seek the master
must do so on foot."

416
00:36:21.478 --> 00:36:23.397
What the hell am I doing here?

417
00:36:24.523 --> 00:36:26.316
I was wondering the same thing.

418
00:36:39.746 --> 00:36:41.915
You must be Marin.

419
00:36:42.749 --> 00:36:44.877
-The Silver Knight.
-You look surprised.

420
00:36:44.960 --> 00:36:47.254
Yeah. No, I'm... I mean...

421
00:36:48.630 --> 00:36:50.257
No offense, I thought you'd be a man.

422
00:36:50.340 --> 00:36:51.800
No offense taken.

423
00:36:51.884 --> 00:36:53.427
I thought the same of you.

424
00:36:55.095 --> 00:36:57.139
What's the training schedule like here?

425
00:36:57.222 --> 00:36:59.349
I only train knights.

426
00:37:01.476 --> 00:37:03.395
I'm told I'm the Pegasus Knight.

427
00:37:05.147 --> 00:37:08.192
You're not the first boy
with a pretty necklace to show up here.

428
00:37:09.359 --> 00:37:11.069
Is there a test I can take or something?

429
00:37:15.741 --> 00:37:17.659
The Pegasus Knight is brave.

430
00:37:20.621 --> 00:37:21.455
Check.

431
00:37:22.206 --> 00:37:23.290
Humble.

432
00:37:23.373 --> 00:37:24.541
Check.

433
00:37:24.625 --> 00:37:27.711
And committed
to protecting Athena with his life.

434
00:37:28.629 --> 00:37:32.257
Okay, that's where this whole situation
gets a little sticky.

435
00:37:32.341 --> 00:37:33.800
See, I lost my sister-- Hey!

436
00:37:35.219 --> 00:37:36.678
I just got up here!

437
00:37:39.640 --> 00:37:40.933
I just got up here.

438
00:37:44.561 --> 00:37:45.812
I'm not going down there.

439
00:38:17.010 --> 00:38:18.595
There's nothing for you here.

440
00:38:19.263 --> 00:38:20.681
What are you? Like, a ninja?

441
00:38:23.851 --> 00:38:26.812
Listen, I only wanna find my sister.
Sienna said you could help.

442
00:38:26.895 --> 00:38:29.356
I knew a knight just like you.

443
00:38:29.439 --> 00:38:31.358
He desired power for his own goals.

444
00:38:31.441 --> 00:38:33.443
-Which was?
-The Phoenix.

445
00:38:33.527 --> 00:38:35.612
The most powerful of Athena's knights.

446
00:38:35.696 --> 00:38:37.739
You mean, aside from the Pegasus Knight.

447
00:38:40.158 --> 00:38:42.035
I'll have Mylock come get you
in the morning.

448
00:38:42.119 --> 00:38:43.787
No. Come on, I made it this far.

449
00:38:43.871 --> 00:38:45.205
And how far is that?

450
00:38:46.123 --> 00:38:47.833
Do you even know how far you need to go?

451
00:38:48.542 --> 00:38:50.168
Just give me one chance.

452
00:38:56.258 --> 00:38:57.759
If you can break this rock...

453
00:38:58.886 --> 00:39:01.013
then you can be my student.

454
00:39:09.771 --> 00:39:10.772
Fair enough.

455
00:39:11.732 --> 00:39:12.941
Where's the hammer?

456
00:39:15.861 --> 00:39:17.988
Come on, I can't break a rock
with my bare hands.

457
00:39:18.780 --> 00:39:19.907
A knight could.

458
00:39:21.867 --> 00:39:23.243
You can't be serious.

459
00:39:26.872 --> 00:39:28.415
You're serious.

460
00:39:44.223 --> 00:39:45.891
I told you, this was stupid!

461
00:39:50.062 --> 00:39:53.899
Your flesh, this rock,
the stars in the sky,

462
00:39:53.982 --> 00:39:57.945
all things in the cosmos are made
from the same atoms.

463
00:39:58.028 --> 00:40:02.282
From the moment we are born,
we all hold a Cosmo within ourselves.

464
00:40:02.366 --> 00:40:05.118
A knight can make it explode.

465
00:40:05.702 --> 00:40:09.706
And shatter the atoms of any object.

466
00:40:14.586 --> 00:40:16.713
How's that supposed to make any sense?

467
00:40:20.384 --> 00:40:21.385
Focus.

468
00:40:23.220 --> 00:40:24.638
Clear your mind.

469
00:40:25.222 --> 00:40:27.266
Feel the Cosmo within you.

470
00:41:03.051 --> 00:41:04.011
<i>Seiya!</i>

471
00:41:08.056 --> 00:41:09.808
This is stupid, it'll never work!

472
00:41:09.892 --> 00:41:11.852
Something clouded your focus
at the last minute.

473
00:41:11.935 --> 00:41:14.646
Figures. Guess I'm not
the Pegasus Knight after all.

474
00:41:14.730 --> 00:41:16.732
No, you're not.

475
00:41:16.815 --> 00:41:18.984
But maybe you will be.

476
00:41:20.235 --> 00:41:21.987
Are you ready to start your training?

477
00:41:38.837 --> 00:41:41.882
It's a good thing he didn't mind
the permanent changes to his body.

478
00:41:41.965 --> 00:41:44.218
-Well...
-What?

479
00:41:44.301 --> 00:41:47.304
I might have forgotten to mention
the permanent part to him.

480
00:41:59.608 --> 00:42:00.776
What the hell is this?

481
00:42:00.859 --> 00:42:02.528
What did you do? You made--

482
00:42:03.195 --> 00:42:05.822
You made me a freaking cyborg!

483
00:42:16.166 --> 00:42:17.668
What is that?

484
00:42:17.751 --> 00:42:19.253
It's the curse of Athena.

485
00:42:21.213 --> 00:42:24.132
The war that awaits us is unlike
any other before.

486
00:42:24.675 --> 00:42:27.386
Our enemies are the gods themselves.

487
00:42:28.595 --> 00:42:30.430
We've all made sacrifices.

488
00:42:32.641 --> 00:42:37.229
But what is flesh in comparison
to the power to crush the immortals?

489
00:42:42.359 --> 00:42:44.069
A war with the gods, huh?

490
00:42:44.152 --> 00:42:46.530
There's only one person I wanna crush.

491
00:42:49.992 --> 00:42:51.702
Well, that was a nice little show.

492
00:42:51.785 --> 00:42:54.079
Let's move on.
We have bigger issues at hand.

493
00:42:54.162 --> 00:42:55.789
-Bigger than his ego?
-Your prisoner.

494
00:42:55.873 --> 00:42:58.375
He's a tough one. I can't get him to talk.

495
00:42:58.458 --> 00:43:01.295
-Any ideas?
-Have you tried asking nicely?

496
00:43:09.052 --> 00:43:10.387
Let's get a baseline.

497
00:43:22.274 --> 00:43:23.984
Show me what you know.

498
00:43:24.067 --> 00:43:26.486
You mean, fight you? Now?

499
00:43:32.993 --> 00:43:34.536
You came here to train, yes?

500
00:43:39.958 --> 00:43:42.211
Is dancing all you can do?

501
00:44:11.281 --> 00:44:13.075
Shouldn't I have a weapon or something?

502
00:44:13.158 --> 00:44:14.993
Athena's knights wield no weapon.

503
00:44:15.661 --> 00:44:16.703
That sucks.

504
00:44:45.482 --> 00:44:46.859
Okay, I felt that one.

505
00:44:46.942 --> 00:44:48.610
It wasn't a direct hit.

506
00:44:55.993 --> 00:44:57.494
How the hell'd you do that?

507
00:44:57.578 --> 00:44:59.204
You want a weapon?

508
00:44:59.288 --> 00:45:01.290
Your Cosmo is your weapon.

509
00:45:01.373 --> 00:45:03.166
Focus your energy,

510
00:45:03.250 --> 00:45:05.377
let it burn inside of you.

511
00:45:05.460 --> 00:45:07.337
Release it all at once.

512
00:45:07.421 --> 00:45:08.463
Like a shooting star.

513
00:45:09.256 --> 00:45:11.175
Felt more like a meteor shower to me.

514
00:45:16.889 --> 00:45:19.766
So do I get to learn
this meteor fist of yours?

515
00:45:19.850 --> 00:45:20.851
You must...

516
00:45:21.393 --> 00:45:24.104
if you want to survive
the battles that await you.

517
00:46:31.547 --> 00:46:32.548
Sienna!

518
00:46:37.302 --> 00:46:38.846
It's all right. It's all right.

519
00:46:38.929 --> 00:46:40.514
It's all right. It's all right.

520
00:46:40.597 --> 00:46:42.224
I'm here. It's all right.

521
00:46:44.643 --> 00:46:47.521
I had another vision. Bad one.

522
00:46:48.730 --> 00:46:50.190
It's okay, it's all gone now.

523
00:46:50.816 --> 00:46:51.650
Dad...

524
00:46:53.527 --> 00:46:56.280
How can you be so sure
I'll grow up to protect the world?

525
00:46:56.363 --> 00:46:58.740
You are the goddess of wisdom, remember?

526
00:46:58.824 --> 00:46:59.867
And warfare.

527
00:47:01.660 --> 00:47:03.161
And you're my baby girl.

528
00:47:03.871 --> 00:47:06.206
The most loving and stubborn.

529
00:47:06.290 --> 00:47:09.001
Nothing could stop you
from doing what's right.

530
00:47:09.084 --> 00:47:10.544
What did you see?

531
00:47:12.796 --> 00:47:15.007
People... burning.

532
00:47:15.090 --> 00:47:16.842
Cities in ruins.

533
00:47:17.593 --> 00:47:19.052
Everything...

534
00:47:20.429 --> 00:47:21.722
destroyed.

535
00:47:21.805 --> 00:47:23.807
We won't let that happen, will we?

536
00:47:23.891 --> 00:47:26.018
You don't understand. It was Athena.

537
00:47:26.101 --> 00:47:27.686
She was doing it. I...

538
00:47:28.979 --> 00:47:30.189
I was doing it.

539
00:47:31.023 --> 00:47:34.484
Visions are just... possibilities.

540
00:47:34.568 --> 00:47:37.404
Dad, I know you'd let
the world burn to keep me safe...

541
00:47:39.239 --> 00:47:41.283
but what if that's not me anymore?

542
00:47:55.964 --> 00:47:58.175
Prove to me you're worthy. Focus.

543
00:48:02.638 --> 00:48:03.847
Is that all you've got?

544
00:48:06.099 --> 00:48:07.226
Your body is here.

545
00:48:08.310 --> 00:48:09.978
But your mind is elsewhere.

546
00:48:18.445 --> 00:48:19.404
<i>Seiya.</i>

547
00:48:19.488 --> 00:48:21.615
There's so many things I need to tell you.

548
00:48:21.698 --> 00:48:23.367
I'm here to protect you.

549
00:48:25.077 --> 00:48:26.495
Now stop my attack.

550
00:48:35.295 --> 00:48:36.547
You're failing.

551
00:48:40.384 --> 00:48:41.802
Was he a knight too?

552
00:48:41.885 --> 00:48:43.262
The Pegasus?

553
00:48:43.929 --> 00:48:47.516
Mind and body must become one.

554
00:48:51.186 --> 00:48:53.730
A knight's power comes from within.

555
00:49:04.825 --> 00:49:06.285
You give up?

556
00:49:10.372 --> 00:49:13.166
If you can't do this,
you'll never be a knight.

557
00:49:24.803 --> 00:49:25.804
You give up?

558
00:50:11.099 --> 00:50:12.893
How did you say you ended up here, again?

559
00:50:13.727 --> 00:50:15.729
I didn't say. And it's none of your--

560
00:50:15.812 --> 00:50:17.940
Right, I'm not supposed to know. I know.

561
00:50:20.108 --> 00:50:23.153
My destiny is bound to this island.

562
00:50:23.987 --> 00:50:26.031
Well, that sounds like a lonely existence.

563
00:50:26.114 --> 00:50:27.824
But not one without purpose.

564
00:50:28.492 --> 00:50:29.493
You know, I...

565
00:50:30.494 --> 00:50:32.079
I have a purpose too.

566
00:50:32.162 --> 00:50:33.705
To find my sister.

567
00:50:33.789 --> 00:50:37.167
A knight should not mistake
obsession for purpose.

568
00:50:37.918 --> 00:50:39.962
I know there is pain in your past...

569
00:50:40.671 --> 00:50:43.841
but beyond that pain,
there lies your strength.

570
00:50:44.508 --> 00:50:47.761
Find it and the armor will accept you.

571
00:50:48.762 --> 00:50:50.764
This is what your sister would've wanted.

572
00:50:52.641 --> 00:50:53.809
Get some sleep.

573
00:52:44.503 --> 00:52:46.380
I get it.

574
00:52:46.463 --> 00:52:48.298
You're tough.

575
00:52:49.049 --> 00:52:53.053
You know, someone once taught me

576
00:52:53.136 --> 00:52:56.014
that all men, no matter how tough,

577
00:52:57.391 --> 00:52:58.892
have something they fear.

578
00:53:06.275 --> 00:53:09.653
I wonder what it is
a big man like you fears the most.

579
00:53:28.672 --> 00:53:30.090
Who are you?

580
00:53:35.220 --> 00:53:38.015
You have no idea what I'm capable of.

581
00:53:40.684 --> 00:53:42.019
Make it stop.

582
00:53:46.190 --> 00:53:47.357
Make it stop!

583
00:53:47.900 --> 00:53:49.234
Make it go away.

584
00:53:50.652 --> 00:53:51.486
Now...

585
00:53:52.738 --> 00:53:55.991
would you mind telling me
where I can find Alman Kido?

586
00:53:57.242 --> 00:53:58.619
Make it stop!

587
00:54:05.209 --> 00:54:09.046
-This one's bigger than the last one.
-And your Cosmo is stronger.

588
00:54:09.129 --> 00:54:11.089
Now, show me what you've learned.

589
00:55:38.969 --> 00:55:40.053
You did it, Seiya.

590
00:55:41.305 --> 00:55:43.098
The Pegasus armor is--

591
00:55:56.778 --> 00:55:59.990
You can't use it. Only the Pegasus can.

592
00:56:00.073 --> 00:56:01.783
That's why you're coming with us.

593
00:56:13.086 --> 00:56:13.921
Alman.

594
00:56:15.339 --> 00:56:16.715
He was a part of it.

595
00:56:18.217 --> 00:56:21.553
He was there when Guraad took Patricia.

596
00:56:26.141 --> 00:56:27.809
I want off this island.

597
00:56:30.687 --> 00:56:31.939
You are not ready.

598
00:56:32.022 --> 00:56:33.941
Your training is not over.

599
00:56:35.317 --> 00:56:36.485
It is now.

600
00:56:47.246 --> 00:56:49.373
Alman's been playing me for a fool!

601
00:56:49.456 --> 00:56:50.999
You must calm down.

602
00:56:51.083 --> 00:56:54.127
If your heart and mind aren't clear,
the armor will reject you.

603
00:56:54.211 --> 00:56:55.712
To hell with the armor!

604
00:57:26.869 --> 00:57:27.870
Seiya.

605
00:57:29.121 --> 00:57:30.330
I don't care.

606
00:57:31.957 --> 00:57:33.667
You can either kill me now...

607
00:57:36.545 --> 00:57:37.838
or send me back.

608
00:57:44.136 --> 00:57:45.971
Let's go. One more round, guys.

609
00:57:47.014 --> 00:57:48.015
Come on.

610
00:57:55.731 --> 00:57:57.065
How's it coming along?

611
00:57:59.943 --> 00:58:02.237
You want this to work, I need more time.

612
00:58:04.156 --> 00:58:05.824
Be careful, you idiot!

613
00:58:11.288 --> 00:58:15.375
Yeah, running out of sparring partners.
You care to join?

614
00:58:15.459 --> 00:58:17.336
Oh, I'm sorry. Busy day.

615
00:58:18.962 --> 00:58:23.509
Right, right. You're playing
with your god-killing toy over here.

616
00:58:24.843 --> 00:58:25.844
Yeah.

617
00:58:27.262 --> 00:58:29.556
So much trouble for one little girl.

618
00:58:29.640 --> 00:58:31.266
You know, if you ask me,

619
00:58:31.350 --> 00:58:34.978
I'd be more than happy to snap her neck
the old-fashioned way.

620
00:58:37.231 --> 00:58:42.152
Any damage to Sienna's body
might awaken Athena's Cosmo within her.

621
00:58:42.236 --> 00:58:44.905
Yeah, I don't even know what that means.

622
00:58:45.531 --> 00:58:49.576
It means you can't dismantle
a nuclear bomb by smashing it with a club.

623
00:58:50.827 --> 00:58:52.287
I'd sure love to try.

624
00:58:53.622 --> 00:58:54.998
It's not happening.

625
00:58:56.500 --> 00:58:57.626
Make it work.

626
00:59:06.385 --> 00:59:07.553
Alman!

627
00:59:07.636 --> 00:59:09.096
I know what you did!

628
00:59:09.972 --> 00:59:12.891
-Come face me, you coward.
-Stand down!

629
00:59:13.725 --> 00:59:15.018
I'll handle this.

630
00:59:15.644 --> 00:59:17.479
-Seiya, please.
-Alman!

631
00:59:18.188 --> 00:59:19.565
Please calm down.

632
00:59:19.648 --> 00:59:20.858
Stand back!

633
00:59:21.859 --> 00:59:23.443
You can't hide from me.

634
00:59:24.152 --> 00:59:25.153
Seiya!

635
00:59:25.737 --> 00:59:28.490
He took Patricia. He was in on it.

636
00:59:28.574 --> 00:59:29.908
There's more to it than that.

637
00:59:29.992 --> 00:59:32.536
No! No, you don't wanna do that.

638
00:59:32.619 --> 00:59:34.121
You don't understand.

639
00:59:34.997 --> 00:59:37.791
Come with me. I'll tell you
what really happened to your sister.

640
00:59:43.547 --> 00:59:45.174
Sienna, you know the rules.

641
00:59:46.508 --> 00:59:50.637
You must not leave the mansion grounds.

642
01:00:23.212 --> 01:00:24.504
You said you have answers.

643
01:00:25.214 --> 01:00:26.048
Hey!

644
01:00:28.008 --> 01:00:30.636
Alman was there when Guraad took Patricia.
He was a part of it.

645
01:00:30.719 --> 01:00:32.471
Tell me I'm wrong.

646
01:00:32.554 --> 01:00:34.556
He did it because of me.

647
01:00:39.186 --> 01:00:41.980
When I was younger,
I had no control at all.

648
01:00:42.064 --> 01:00:45.317
One night, my mom was holding me
and I had a burst of Cosmo.

649
01:00:45.400 --> 01:00:46.860
I don't even know how it happened.

650
01:00:46.944 --> 01:00:50.906
All I remember is she was holding me
and I destroyed her arms.

651
01:00:50.989 --> 01:00:53.784
And the next moment,
she was dying and it was all my fault.

652
01:00:53.867 --> 01:00:56.537
Alman used the power
of the gold armor to save her,

653
01:00:56.620 --> 01:00:59.915
but ever since the accident,
Guraad needs Cosmo to stay alive.

654
01:00:59.998 --> 01:01:02.084
So what? You've got plenty of it.

655
01:01:02.167 --> 01:01:04.878
Athena's Cosmo's too powerful.
It would kill her.

656
01:01:04.962 --> 01:01:08.090
That's why she sought out kids
like your sister.

657
01:01:08.173 --> 01:01:09.591
What did she do to Pat?

658
01:01:09.675 --> 01:01:11.718
Your sister didn't have any Cosmo.

659
01:01:11.802 --> 01:01:14.263
Once Guraad figured that out,
she let her go.

660
01:01:14.930 --> 01:01:16.682
But she sent her men to watch her.

661
01:01:16.765 --> 01:01:19.101
Guraad knew Patricia was hiding something.

662
01:01:20.269 --> 01:01:21.270
Me.

663
01:01:23.605 --> 01:01:25.440
That's why she never came back.

664
01:01:25.524 --> 01:01:28.485
Look, I'm sorry, Seiya. If I knew, I...

665
01:01:33.490 --> 01:01:35.492
My mother was never the same
after the incident.

666
01:01:35.576 --> 01:01:39.830
She became convinced that Athena
had returned to this world to end it.

667
01:01:40.747 --> 01:01:43.375
She was gonna kill me,
so my father forced me into hiding.

668
01:01:43.458 --> 01:01:44.835
And left Pat behind.

669
01:01:46.920 --> 01:01:48.839
Your sister wasn't the only one.

670
01:01:50.757 --> 01:01:52.217
We left them all behind.

671
01:01:55.012 --> 01:01:56.722
How many kids did your family take?

672
01:02:04.479 --> 01:02:06.815
Our radar picked up Guraad's signature.

673
01:02:11.069 --> 01:02:12.571
So it is happening.

674
01:02:13.155 --> 01:02:14.865
We don't stand a chance.

675
01:02:14.948 --> 01:02:19.453
You need to get out of here.
I'll buy you as much time as I can.

676
01:02:19.536 --> 01:02:21.246
I'm not running from a fight.

677
01:02:21.747 --> 01:02:23.248
Find Sienna.

678
01:02:24.291 --> 01:02:25.292
Protect her.

679
01:02:26.376 --> 01:02:28.503
You're the only one I can trust.

680
01:02:35.928 --> 01:02:37.137
And, Mylock?

681
01:02:38.847 --> 01:02:40.516
You've been a good friend.

682
01:02:42.726 --> 01:02:43.727
Thank you.

683
01:02:51.235 --> 01:02:54.196
After Pat was taken, I ran away.

684
01:02:55.364 --> 01:02:58.158
All these years,
I've never stopped looking for her.

685
01:03:00.244 --> 01:03:02.746
Turns out she was the one
who was keeping away from me.

686
01:03:03.413 --> 01:03:04.998
Your sister sacrificed herself

687
01:03:05.082 --> 01:03:06.917
because she believed
in what you really are.

688
01:03:07.000 --> 01:03:08.710
I never asked to be a knight.

689
01:03:11.296 --> 01:03:13.048
I only wanted to be with Pat.

690
01:03:14.758 --> 01:03:16.802
You think I wanted any of this?

691
01:03:18.387 --> 01:03:22.057
Sometimes I feel like
I'm a guest in my own body.

692
01:03:24.101 --> 01:03:26.603
In time,
I thought I'd learn to control it.

693
01:03:27.437 --> 01:03:28.856
But you're fighting it.

694
01:03:31.817 --> 01:03:33.485
What if my mother was right?

695
01:03:37.531 --> 01:03:41.952
What if I was only born
to bring ruin and misery into this world?

696
01:03:42.035 --> 01:03:43.829
That's not who you are.

697
01:03:47.499 --> 01:03:48.584
How do you know?

698
01:03:50.836 --> 01:03:52.504
I guess I just know.

699
01:03:59.928 --> 01:04:01.555
I need you to promise me...

700
01:04:02.472 --> 01:04:03.932
if things go wrong...

701
01:04:04.808 --> 01:04:08.520
if, in the end, I become a goddess of war
and I can't control my powers...

702
01:04:10.856 --> 01:04:14.318
you will stop me, at all costs.

703
01:04:15.027 --> 01:04:17.779
-You don't mean--
-Just promise me, please.

704
01:04:21.617 --> 01:04:23.202
That's my mother.

705
01:04:27.623 --> 01:04:29.333
Sienna, wait, you can't go back!

706
01:04:29.416 --> 01:04:32.628
-You're the one she's after.
-I have to help my father.

707
01:04:34.004 --> 01:04:35.005
Okay.

708
01:04:36.006 --> 01:04:37.007
I'm with you.

709
01:04:37.925 --> 01:04:38.926
For now.

710
01:05:12.626 --> 01:05:13.627
Shut it! Shut it!

711
01:05:16.255 --> 01:05:17.256
Hold.

712
01:05:29.560 --> 01:05:30.519
Don't let them through!

713
01:05:46.869 --> 01:05:47.828
No! No--!

714
01:06:01.175 --> 01:06:02.176
It's clear.

715
01:06:26.408 --> 01:06:27.409
Where's Seiya?

716
01:06:28.327 --> 01:06:29.411
And whatever her name is?

717
01:06:29.494 --> 01:06:33.290
Sienna is not here,
but I am willing to make a deal.

718
01:06:33.373 --> 01:06:35.918
Old man, you are in no position
to be making deals.

719
01:06:36.001 --> 01:06:37.878
Wait outside, Cassios.

720
01:06:39.171 --> 01:06:40.631
-Are you serious?
-Out!

721
01:06:48.263 --> 01:06:49.264
Hey!

722
01:06:54.478 --> 01:06:56.522
I really need to get to this ship.

723
01:07:12.079 --> 01:07:13.580
Glad you understand.

724
01:07:23.549 --> 01:07:25.634
How do you like my special bullets?

725
01:07:31.223 --> 01:07:32.891
Let's make this easy, shall we?

726
01:07:32.975 --> 01:07:34.768
Just tell me where she is.

727
01:07:37.145 --> 01:07:38.564
Straight to business, then.

728
01:07:38.647 --> 01:07:40.816
What do you expect,
after she almost killed me?

729
01:07:40.899 --> 01:07:43.110
That was an accident and you know it.

730
01:07:43.193 --> 01:07:44.653
You can't blame Sienna for it.

731
01:07:44.736 --> 01:07:46.655
Oh, I never blamed Sienna.

732
01:07:46.738 --> 01:07:48.156
I blamed you, Alman,

733
01:07:48.782 --> 01:07:50.868
for leaving me
to make all the hard choices.

734
01:07:50.951 --> 01:07:53.954
How is murdering a little girl
even a choice?

735
01:07:54.037 --> 01:07:56.999
She's a sword of Damocles
hanging over all of us.

736
01:07:57.082 --> 01:07:59.751
-She's your daughter.
-We never had a daughter!

737
01:08:01.295 --> 01:08:04.131
What we had was an agreement, remember?

738
01:08:04.214 --> 01:08:07.801
That when she'd go out of control,
we'd do whatever had to be done together.

739
01:08:07.885 --> 01:08:11.054
Sienna was entrusted to me.

740
01:08:13.682 --> 01:08:15.225
I'm responsible for her.

741
01:08:15.809 --> 01:08:17.101
I believe in her.

742
01:08:17.185 --> 01:08:19.479
You must believe in our child too.

743
01:08:25.234 --> 01:08:28.529
What about all the children
you took to make these?

744
01:08:31.491 --> 01:08:33.243
Weren't you responsible for them?

745
01:08:33.911 --> 01:08:35.871
It was the only way to save you.

746
01:08:35.953 --> 01:08:38.165
And now I must save
the rest of us from her.

747
01:08:48.634 --> 01:08:50.051
Speaking of the devil.

748
01:08:57.350 --> 01:08:58.435
Dad?

749
01:09:10.072 --> 01:09:12.866
I didn't want to do this,
but I won't let you hurt her.

750
01:09:12.949 --> 01:09:14.284
I know.

751
01:09:14.368 --> 01:09:15.452
Cassios!

752
01:09:24.752 --> 01:09:25.754
Enough!

753
01:09:27.922 --> 01:09:30.551
Get me the girl.
You can do what you want with the boy.

754
01:09:46.733 --> 01:09:48.109
Seiya!

755
01:09:53.448 --> 01:09:54.491
We need to go.

756
01:09:56.994 --> 01:09:59.913
Hey there. I'm gonna take the girl now.

757
01:10:00.831 --> 01:10:02.291
But first, I want you.

758
01:10:02.374 --> 01:10:03.625
Let's end this now.

759
01:10:03.709 --> 01:10:05.127
-No, Seiya. Don't.
-It's okay.

760
01:10:06.461 --> 01:10:07.588
I've got the armor.

761
01:10:12.551 --> 01:10:13.802
Any time now.

762
01:10:16.597 --> 01:10:18.390
Sienna, stay back!

763
01:10:44.041 --> 01:10:45.834
Things have changed, kid.

764
01:10:45.918 --> 01:10:48.170
Face it, you don't have what it takes.

765
01:11:57.281 --> 01:11:59.283
I loved these glasses.

766
01:12:43.994 --> 01:12:45.370
Stop! Stop!

767
01:12:46.496 --> 01:12:49.041
You've won.
I'm coming with you. Let him go.

768
01:12:51.126 --> 01:12:53.086
You're coming with me anyway.

769
01:13:12.981 --> 01:13:14.650
Rescue on the way, kids.

770
01:13:34.670 --> 01:13:35.671
I'm sorry,

771
01:13:35.754 --> 01:13:38.632
but I'm taking you down with me.

772
01:13:43.095 --> 01:13:44.471
Go! Go! Go!

773
01:14:39.985 --> 01:14:41.069
No.

774
01:15:12.434 --> 01:15:13.435
It's ready.

775
01:15:16.730 --> 01:15:17.856
Give me a minute.

776
01:15:22.027 --> 01:15:23.028
Leave.

777
01:15:47.886 --> 01:15:50.764
You must think
I'm the worst mother in the world.

778
01:15:51.431 --> 01:15:54.226
You... You killed Father.

779
01:15:55.394 --> 01:15:56.979
Alman chose his own way,

780
01:15:57.062 --> 01:16:00.274
and left me
to clean up his mess, as always.

781
01:16:09.491 --> 01:16:11.285
Athena's Cosmo is too strong.

782
01:16:12.077 --> 01:16:13.871
It won't fix you.

783
01:16:13.954 --> 01:16:14.788
I know.

784
01:16:16.957 --> 01:16:20.627
Yeah. I gave up
on fixing this body a long time ago.

785
01:16:26.675 --> 01:16:29.178
We both have a bomb ticking inside.

786
01:16:30.596 --> 01:16:35.726
Except yours is gonna be so much louder
if we let it go off.

787
01:16:44.276 --> 01:16:46.236
I know I'm doing the right thing.

788
01:16:52.242 --> 01:16:55.537
I just wanted you to know
it doesn't make it any easier.

789
01:17:09.551 --> 01:17:10.802
Will it hurt much?

790
01:17:13.597 --> 01:17:14.598
I don't know.

791
01:17:37.538 --> 01:17:38.914
We need to start.

792
01:17:45.963 --> 01:17:47.089
Do it.

793
01:18:33.844 --> 01:18:34.887
Sienna...

794
01:18:46.315 --> 01:18:48.108
That ain't gonna help, kiddo.

795
01:18:49.943 --> 01:18:51.570
I let her get taken.

796
01:18:52.821 --> 01:18:53.822
I failed.

797
01:18:56.700 --> 01:18:57.784
We all did.

798
01:18:58.368 --> 01:18:59.995
I was supposed to protect her.

799
01:19:00.078 --> 01:19:02.915
Things don't always work out
the way we expect them to.

800
01:19:13.592 --> 01:19:14.885
Come on, Seiya.

801
01:19:37.491 --> 01:19:38.742
Marin.

802
01:19:41.995 --> 01:19:43.413
You were right about me.

803
01:19:45.374 --> 01:19:46.375
I failed.

804
01:19:50.045 --> 01:19:51.213
I'm not a knight.

805
01:19:53.215 --> 01:19:54.550
I couldn't save her.

806
01:19:55.717 --> 01:20:00.556
A knight should not mistake
obsession for purpose.

807
01:20:06.728 --> 01:20:09.064
Seiya, focus.

808
01:20:09.982 --> 01:20:12.025
Who is it that you're trying to save?

809
01:20:19.491 --> 01:20:20.325
Pat.

810
01:20:26.206 --> 01:20:27.291
What does this...?

811
01:20:27.875 --> 01:20:30.294
<i>Who are you really trying to save?</i>

812
01:20:55.194 --> 01:20:56.320
I'm sorry.

813
01:20:57.321 --> 01:20:59.072
I'm so sorry.

814
01:21:13.420 --> 01:21:14.463
I know.

815
01:21:16.757 --> 01:21:17.799
It's okay.

816
01:21:20.719 --> 01:21:22.012
It wasn't your fault.

817
01:21:23.805 --> 01:21:24.806
Okay.

818
01:21:44.493 --> 01:21:45.619
I'll bring her back.

819
01:21:54.628 --> 01:21:55.754
I promise.

820
01:21:56.463 --> 01:21:57.506
Okay.

821
01:22:07.641 --> 01:22:09.351
Let's go get Sienna back.

822
01:22:28.328 --> 01:22:29.663
How long will it take?

823
01:22:30.289 --> 01:22:33.500
To kill a god? Good question.

824
01:22:33.584 --> 01:22:35.002
We're about to find out.

825
01:23:03.447 --> 01:23:06.617
Oh, boy. They got us on radar.

826
01:23:06.700 --> 01:23:08.118
-What?
-Get ready.

827
01:23:08.202 --> 01:23:09.203
For what?

828
01:23:09.786 --> 01:23:12.956
I can get you close, but I can't land.

829
01:23:14.291 --> 01:23:15.334
Parachute?

830
01:23:17.836 --> 01:23:19.713
Who says you're not funny?

831
01:23:21.423 --> 01:23:23.091
It's now or never!

832
01:23:26.053 --> 01:23:27.054
Open the doors.

833
01:23:38.315 --> 01:23:39.942
Get yourself out of here!

834
01:23:41.235 --> 01:23:42.528
Godspeed, kiddo.

835
01:25:17.414 --> 01:25:18.916
-Out of the way.
-Hey!

836
01:25:20.042 --> 01:25:21.293
He's mine.

837
01:25:23.629 --> 01:25:25.839
Big deal. You know how to glow.

838
01:25:25.923 --> 01:25:28.842
Step aside, Cassios,
if you don't wanna get hurt.

839
01:25:28.926 --> 01:25:29.760
Hurt?

840
01:25:31.428 --> 01:25:33.931
You should've died
when you had the chance.

841
01:25:51.448 --> 01:25:53.033
What was it that you said, Cassios?

842
01:25:55.160 --> 01:25:56.161
Right.

843
01:26:00.249 --> 01:26:01.083
Oh, no.

844
01:26:01.708 --> 01:26:02.960
Things have changed.

845
01:26:10.509 --> 01:26:13.679
Finally,
the goddess Athena reveals herself.

846
01:26:19.852 --> 01:26:22.104
<i>You must believe in our child too.</i>

847
01:26:27.693 --> 01:26:30.195
Stop! Stop the procedure!

848
01:26:30.279 --> 01:26:32.239
It'll be over soon.

849
01:26:32.322 --> 01:26:33.574
Now!

850
01:26:34.408 --> 01:26:36.326
We are not stopping!

851
01:26:36.410 --> 01:26:37.995
Get out of my way.

852
01:26:39.788 --> 01:26:40.873
Guards!

853
01:26:44.877 --> 01:26:47.254
Your services are no longer required.

854
01:26:47.337 --> 01:26:48.964
There's no stopping it now.

855
01:26:49.047 --> 01:26:52.050
In moments,
she'll be nothing but a memory.

856
01:26:55.053 --> 01:26:56.138
Kill him!

857
01:27:59.868 --> 01:28:01.787
You said it yourself, Guraad.

858
01:28:02.496 --> 01:28:06.875
When one goes to war with the gods,
sacrifices must be made.

859
01:28:08.794 --> 01:28:11.672
There must be another way
to protect humanity.

860
01:28:11.755 --> 01:28:13.507
Protect humanity?

861
01:28:14.174 --> 01:28:15.759
Is that what you think you're doing?

862
01:28:35.070 --> 01:28:37.281
Killing Athena was only
half of the battle.

863
01:28:45.831 --> 01:28:48.000
This is the other half.

864
01:28:50.419 --> 01:28:51.795
The gold armor.

865
01:29:05.309 --> 01:29:06.852
Can't let you do that.

866
01:29:06.935 --> 01:29:09.021
Thought you were the only knight in town?

867
01:29:09.646 --> 01:29:11.023
You gotta get out of the way.

868
01:30:24.555 --> 01:30:25.389
Sienna!

869
01:30:57.087 --> 01:30:59.173
You're no match for the Phoenix.

870
01:31:10.350 --> 01:31:12.102
Why do you try so hard?

871
01:31:13.645 --> 01:31:15.022
She's not worth it.

872
01:31:15.772 --> 01:31:17.608
She's not even human.

873
01:31:18.525 --> 01:31:20.402
Sienna's not a god of war.

874
01:31:20.485 --> 01:31:23.113
I don't care what kind of god she is.

875
01:31:23.197 --> 01:31:24.740
Man needs no gods!

876
01:31:59.399 --> 01:32:01.193
You don't know when to quit.

877
01:32:01.276 --> 01:32:02.736
People keep telling me that.

878
01:32:44.695 --> 01:32:46.697
Stop, you fool!

879
01:33:22.441 --> 01:33:23.901
Sienna!

880
01:33:24.526 --> 01:33:26.945
Listen to me!
That's not your friend anymore!

881
01:33:30.532 --> 01:33:32.451
She's become the goddess of war.

882
01:33:32.534 --> 01:33:33.911
We have to stop her!

883
01:34:29.466 --> 01:34:30.676
<i>Seiya.</i>

884
01:34:30.759 --> 01:34:32.094
<i>I'm losing control.</i>

885
01:34:33.846 --> 01:34:36.723
<i>I don't think
I can hold her back much longer.</i>

886
01:34:43.438 --> 01:34:45.482
<i>You can't save me,</i>

887
01:34:45.566 --> 01:34:47.985
<i>but you can stop Athena.</i>

888
01:34:49.903 --> 01:34:51.405
<i>You must do it now.</i>

889
01:34:52.239 --> 01:34:53.657
<i>At all costs.</i>

890
01:35:49.213 --> 01:35:50.339
Sienna...

891
01:35:51.965 --> 01:35:53.300
you're not a goddess of war.

892
01:35:55.135 --> 01:35:56.803
No one's destiny...

893
01:35:57.763 --> 01:35:59.264
is written in stone.

894
01:36:02.226 --> 01:36:03.393
Not even yours.

895
01:36:10.776 --> 01:36:12.569
The guardian of mankind...

896
01:36:13.403 --> 01:36:15.072
or a petulant jerk...

897
01:36:17.824 --> 01:36:21.328
whatever you choose to be,
I'll never give up on you.

898
01:37:22.723 --> 01:37:23.724
Seiya.

899
01:37:33.483 --> 01:37:34.735
What? Why?

900
01:37:35.319 --> 01:37:37.988
-What was that for?
-Who's the petulant jerk?

901
01:37:38.655 --> 01:37:39.698
Oh, my...

902
01:37:40.782 --> 01:37:41.950
Okay.

903
01:37:43.744 --> 01:37:45.078
-Get up.
-Okay.

904
01:37:51.627 --> 01:37:53.045
Let's get out of here.

905
01:37:55.422 --> 01:37:56.423
Wait.

906
01:38:26.036 --> 01:38:27.079
I'm sorry.

907
01:38:28.288 --> 01:38:29.790
I was wrong about you.

908
01:38:31.208 --> 01:38:34.419
I wasn't so sure myself
for a very long time.

909
01:39:20.174 --> 01:39:21.800
You didn't have to do that.

910
01:39:24.094 --> 01:39:25.137
Yes, I did.

911
01:39:44.698 --> 01:39:46.033
Did I do this?

912
01:39:52.539 --> 01:39:53.540
Mylock!

913
01:39:54.082 --> 01:39:55.209
Sienna!

914
01:39:58.712 --> 01:39:59.713
Are you okay?

915
01:40:00.339 --> 01:40:01.340
I'm okay.

916
01:40:11.558 --> 01:40:12.893
Glad you made it, Seiya.

917
01:40:14.186 --> 01:40:15.187
You too.

918
01:41:01.108 --> 01:41:02.526
So, boss...

919
01:41:04.194 --> 01:41:05.529
what do we do now?

920
01:41:07.739 --> 01:41:11.618
Athena's awakening is a sign the old gods
will soon return and try to start a war.

921
01:41:14.246 --> 01:41:17.040
We need to gather all the Knights
of the Zodiac to stop them.

922
01:41:21.211 --> 01:41:24.214
I'm at your service, my lord.

923
01:41:28.010 --> 01:41:29.845
Stop. Don't call me that.

924
01:41:29.928 --> 01:41:31.346
Whatever you say, princess.

925
01:41:32.598 --> 01:41:34.474
No. And definitely not that.

926
01:41:42.608 --> 01:41:45.110
Before we gather the knights,
there's something else we need to do.

927
01:41:46.111 --> 01:41:47.112
What's that?

928
01:41:50.032 --> 01:41:51.950
It's time to find Patricia.

929
01:41:57.122 --> 01:41:58.123
Thank you.

930
01:41:59.625 --> 01:42:01.293
It's the least a goddess could do.
